{
  "title": "Default Arguments & Flexibility",
  "subtitle": "Making Parameters Optional with Fallback Defaults",
  "topic": "6.1 • DEFAULT ARGUMENTS",
  "body": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; width: 100%;\">\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4px; width: 100%;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #111111; padding: 4px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">\n      6.1 • Flexible Functions\n    </div>\n    <h1 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 8px 0; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n      <hlt>Default Arguments</hlt>\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #222222; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 640px;\">\n      You can assign default values to parameters. If the caller provides an argument, it overrides the default; otherwise, Python uses the fallback!\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background: #c4b5fd; border: 3px solid #111111; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #111111; border-radius: 4px; padding: 20px;\">\n    <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #ffffff; color: #111111; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #111111; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n      Code Pattern\n    </span>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Title', 'Body', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 10px 0; text-transform: uppercase;\">\n      Fallback Parameters in Action\n    </h2>\n    <div style=\"background: #0d1117; border: 2px solid #111111; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #111111; padding: 12px 14px; font-family: 'Consolas', monospace; color: #f0f6fc; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 4px;\">\n      <span style=\"color: #ff7b72;\">def</span> <span style=\"color: #d2a8ff;\">greet</span>(name, greeting=<span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Hello\"</span>):<br/>\n      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff7b72;\">return</span> greeting + <span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\", \"</span> + name + <span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"!\"</span><br/><br/>\n      <span style=\"color: #79c0ff;\">print</span>(greet(<span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Maya\"</span>))             <span style=\"color: #8b949e;\"># Uses default: \"Hello, Maya!\"</span><br/>\n      <span style=\"color: #79c0ff;\">print</span>(greet(<span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Maya\"</span>, <span style=\"color: #a5d6ff;\">\"Welcome\"</span>))   <span style=\"color: #8b949e;\"># Overrides: \"Welcome, Maya!\"</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
}